{"id":"3cced0e71a2282b9","group":"14","path":"14/14-df-topos-point.md","title":"Definition — 拓扑斯的点","display":"Definition — 拓扑斯的点","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane & Moerdijk)","book_abbrev":"14","label":"14-df-topos-point","aliases":["14-df-topos-point"],"display":"Definition — 拓扑斯的点","depends_on":["[[14-df-elementary-topos]]","[[14-df-geometric-morphism]]","[[14-df-category]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane &amp; Moerdijk)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"14"},{"key":"label","html":"14-df-topos-point"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>14-df-topos-point</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Definition — 拓扑斯的点"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4e6c05c92e3b9bf9\" href=\"?note=4e6c05c92e3b9bf9\" title=\"14-df-elementary-topos\">14-df-elementary-topos</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"9752b779c5f463f9\" href=\"?note=9752b779c5f463f9\" title=\"14-df-geometric-morphism\">14-df-geometric-morphism</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"28211adc1b0ce5bc\" href=\"?note=28211adc1b0ce5bc\" title=\"14-df-category\">14-df-category</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E\">\\(\\mathcal E\\)</span> 为初等拓扑斯；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U}\">\\(\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U}\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"28211adc1b0ce5bc\" href=\"?note=28211adc1b0ce5bc\" title=\"14-df-category\">14-df-category</a> 中相对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal U\">\\(\\mathcal U\\)</span> 的集合拓扑斯。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IsPoint}(p,\\mathcal E)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{IsGeometricMorphism}(p,\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U},\\mathcal E).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{IsPoint}(p,\\mathcal E)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{IsGeometricMorphism}(p,\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U},\\mathcal E).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 VII.5。对空间层拓扑斯中由实际点给出的几何态射，逆像就是该点的茎；一般点不应预先被等同某个未给定空间的茎。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"14-df-elementary-topos","status":"resolved","id":"4e6c05c92e3b9bf9","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-elementary-topos]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-geometric-morphism","status":"resolved","id":"9752b779c5f463f9","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-geometric-morphism]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-category","status":"resolved","id":"28211adc1b0ce5bc","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-category]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-category","status":"resolved","id":"28211adc1b0ce5bc","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal E$ 为初等拓扑斯；$\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U}$ 是 [[14-df-category]] 中相对 $\\mathcal U$ 的集合拓扑斯。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal E","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal U","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{IsPoint}(p,\\mathcal E)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{IsGeometricMorphism}(p,\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U},\\mathcal E).","display":true}],"bytes":800,"backlinks":[{"id":"c53146be63465990","anchor":"ref-233","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-topos-point|Definition — 拓扑斯的点]]"},{"id":"4a60f42d4d762a6d","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal E$ 为初等拓扑斯；点见 [[14-df-topos-point]]，点 $p$ 的逆像取值于 $\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U}$。$\\mathrm{IsIso}_{\\mathcal E}$ 与 $\\mathrm{IsIso}_{\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U}}$ 均采用 [[14-df-isomorphism]]，并明确区分其环境。点数据在固定宇宙 $\\mathcal V$ 中量化。"},{"id":"4741fef73eb1a614","anchor":"ref-68","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-topos-point]]"},{"id":"c60ad289d123497b","anchor":"ref-234","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-topos-point|Definition — 拓扑斯的点]]"},{"id":"3130f90b274154ec","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal E$ 为 Grothendieck 拓扑斯；点与足够多点见 [[14-df-topos-point]]、[[14-df-enough-points]]。"},{"id":"288974bbe429c3b2","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$X$ 是 [[14-df-frame-homomorphism-locale]] 的 locale；$\\mathbf2$ 是 [[14-df-frame]] 显式构造的两元素框架。$\\mathbf{Sh}(X)$ 见 [[14-df-locale-sites-and-sheaves]]，$\\mathrm{IsPoint}$ 见 [[14-df-topos-point]]。$\\mathrm{Funs}$ 见 [[14-df-functor-full-subcategory]]，自然同构见 [[14-df-natural-isomorphism-fully-faithful-functor]]。$P_X$ 是下式给出的所有几何点的数据集合；$\\sim_X$ 的定义域为 $P_X^2$。$\\mathrm{Pt}(X)$ 是 locale 点的集合，$P_X/{\\sim_X}$ 是几何点的同构类商集。"}],"outgoing":["4e6c05c92e3b9bf9","9752b779c5f463f9","28211adc1b0ce5bc"]}